# Line endings are load-bearing here, not cosmetic.
#
# `scripts/verify_slice_37.sh` and `scripts/verify_slice_38.sh` guard against a
# schema left unregenerated by hashing `schemas/*.json` before and after
# `cargo test`. `export_schemas` writes LF. Without this file a Windows checkout
# gets CRLF, so the before-digest is over CRLF bytes and the after-digest is over
# LF bytes, and the verifier reports "schemas/ did not match the types they are
# generated from" when nothing has drifted at all. Demonstrated, not assumed: the
# two digests differ by every byte while the content is identical.
#
# Shell scripts are pinned for the plainer reason that `#!/usr/bin/env bash\r`
# is not a shebang.
*.json  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
